---
// One LSTM step: the cell state (top line) is edited by three gates instead of being rewritten.
---
<figure class="p15m">
  <div class="scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 340" role="img" aria-label="One LSTM step. A long cell-state line runs along the top. The forget gate multiplies it by a number between 0 and 1, the input gate adds new information, and the output gate decides what part of it becomes the hidden state that leaves to the right. Today's input and yesterday's hidden state feed all three gates from below.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>An LSTM step: a memory line with three gates</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một bước LSTM: đường bộ nhớ và ba cổng</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="48" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>The memory (cell state) is edited, not rewritten.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bộ nhớ (cell state) được chỉnh sửa, không bị ghi đè.</tspan></text>

    <line x1="40" y1="90" x2="850" y2="90" class="mem" />
    <polygon points="850,84 850,96 862,90" class="headm" />
    <text x="250" y="66" class="mt"><tspan data-lang-en>cell state c: yesterday's memory</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cell state c: bộ nhớ hôm qua</tspan></text>
    <text x="840" y="66" text-anchor="end" class="mt"><tspan data-lang-en>to tomorrow</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>sang ngày mai</tspan></text>

    <circle cx="200" cy="90" r="17" class="op" />
    <text x="200" y="96" text-anchor="middle" class="opt">×</text>
    <circle cx="420" cy="90" r="17" class="op" />
    <text x="420" y="96" text-anchor="middle" class="opt">+</text>

    <rect x="140" y="170" width="120" height="58" rx="8" class="gate forget" />
    <text x="200" y="195" text-anchor="middle" class="gt"><tspan data-lang-en>forget gate</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cổng quên</tspan></text>
    <text x="200" y="214" text-anchor="middle" class="gs"><tspan data-lang-en>keep 0 to 100%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>giữ 0 đến 100%</tspan></text>
    <line x1="200" y1="170" x2="200" y2="108" class="wire" />

    <rect x="330" y="170" width="120" height="58" rx="8" class="gate" />
    <text x="390" y="195" text-anchor="middle" class="gt"><tspan data-lang-en>input gate</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cổng vào</tspan></text>
    <text x="390" y="214" text-anchor="middle" class="gs"><tspan data-lang-en>write new facts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ghi thông tin mới</tspan></text>
    <line x1="420" y1="170" x2="420" y2="108" class="wire" />

    <circle cx="640" cy="130" r="17" class="op" />
    <text x="640" y="136" text-anchor="middle" class="opt">×</text>
    <line x1="640" y1="90" x2="640" y2="113" class="wire" />
    <rect x="580" y="170" width="120" height="58" rx="8" class="gate" />
    <text x="640" y="195" text-anchor="middle" class="gt"><tspan data-lang-en>output gate</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cổng ra</tspan></text>
    <text x="640" y="214" text-anchor="middle" class="gs"><tspan data-lang-en>what to show</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>phần nào để lộ</tspan></text>
    <line x1="640" y1="170" x2="640" y2="147" class="wire" />
    <line x1="657" y1="130" x2="740" y2="130" class="wire" />
    <polygon points="740,124 740,136 752,130" class="headw" />
    <text x="760" y="135" class="gt"><tspan data-lang-en>h: output</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>h: đầu ra</tspan></text>

    <line x1="140" y1="290" x2="700" y2="290" class="wire" />
    <line x1="200" y1="290" x2="200" y2="228" class="wire" />
    <line x1="390" y1="290" x2="390" y2="228" class="wire" />
    <line x1="640" y1="290" x2="640" y2="228" class="wire" />
    <text x="420" y="314" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>inputs to every gate: today's data x and yesterday's output h</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đầu vào của mọi cổng: dữ liệu hôm nay x và đầu ra hôm qua h</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>If the forget gate stays near 1, the memory line carries a fact across many steps almost untouched. A plain recurrent cell has no such line.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Nếu cổng quên giữ gần 1, đường bộ nhớ mang một thông tin đi qua nhiều bước gần như nguyên vẹn. Ô hồi quy thường không có đường nào như vậy.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p15m { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p15m .scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p15m svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .p15m text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p15m .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p15m .sub { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p15m .mem { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 3; }
  .p15m .headm { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .p15m .mt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .p15m .op { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .p15m .opt { font-size: 18px; fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .p15m .gate { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .p15m .gate.forget { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .p15m .gt { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .p15m .gs { fill: var(--text); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .p15m .wire { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .p15m .headw { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p15m figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
